OL,3,GNEWSADrumcree: Major public safety
OL,4,Aoperation under way as NI Secretary
OL,5,Aappeals for calm
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Police Service of Northern Ireland
OL,8,F(PSNI) has said a "major public safety
OL,9,Foperation" will continue in Portadown
OL,10,Fthis weekend.
OL,12,FThe PSNI is "continuing to seek safe
OL,13,Fand peaceful compliance with the
OL,14,FParades Commission determination" at
OL,15,FDrumcree and said its "investigation
OL,16,Finto anyone suspected of breaking the
OL,17,Flaw related to this dispute is
OL,18,Fcontinuing at pace".
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,414,410,260,120,0,100
