OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSADrumcree: Major public safety
OL,4,Aoperation under way as NI Secretary
OL,5,Aappeals for calm
OL,6,
OL,7,FNorthern Ireland Secretary Sir Chris
OL,8,FBryant urged calm this weekend and said
OL,9,F"everyone across Northern Ireland wants
OL,10,Fa peaceful resolution to the
OL,11,Fsituation".
OL,13,FOn Wednesday, the PSNI chief constable
OL,14,Fsaid there would be an investigation
OL,15,Fafter protesters blocked the mainly
OL,16,Fnationalist road to prevent an Orange
OL,17,FOrder parade from happening.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
